&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence tools, conversational AI, or predictive pipeline analytics to accelerate commercial deal velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience selling security, SaaS, or enterprise software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business or a related field of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
