&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet,&amp;nbsp;clients&amp;nbsp;and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
