&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please click here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cannondale.com/-/media/files/privacy-policy/74applicant-privacy-policycannondale-en.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy | Cannondale (English)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cannondale.com/-/media/files/privacy-policy/74applicant-privacy-policycannondale-nlnl.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy | Cannondale (Dutch).&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
