&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and senior leadership to define our international go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help transform one of the world’s largest industries while building toward a $10B+ outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring our first Enterprise Account Executives in EMEA to build Pallet’s commercial presence across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own net-new enterprise acquisition across the region, build relationships with the largest logistics providers in Europe, and help establish the playbook for our international expansion. This is a highly consultative enterprise sales role focused on educating customers on an entirely new category of AI-powered workflow automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Solutions, and Customer Success to drive a solution-selling motion centered around workflow discovery, AI use case identification, structured pilots, and measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially, this role will be remote from London while we establish our UK presence. Once our London office opens, this role will transition to working from the office five days per week when not traveling to customer sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full enterprise sales cycle across EMEA, from outbound prospecting through contract signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a 3x-4x qualified pipeline through disciplined outbound execution while self-sourcing at least 30% of opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders across Europe’s largest logistics providers, including COO, CIO, VP Operations, VP Supply Chain, and VP Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative discovery sessions that map operational workflows to Pallet’s AI agent capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and lead structured pilots that demonstrate measurable operational ROI and convert into enterprise deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive business cases that align operational improvements with financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document repeatable customer use cases and market feedback to shape Pallet’s product roadmap and international GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish Pallet as the leading AI platform for enterprise logistics across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise B2B SaaS or enterprise logistics sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent French: you can run discovery, negotiate and present to executives in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently closing six- and seven-figure enterprise software agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling and value-based sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex buying committees and long enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with senior operators and technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling technical, workflow-heavy software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand complex logistics operations and translate them into compelling AI automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent outbound prospecting and territory-building discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling into logistics, supply chain, transportation, or warehouse operations is strongly preferred but not required. Candidates without logistics experience should demonstrate an ability to quickly learn operational workflows and become trusted advisors to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working hours are generally &lt;strong&gt;9:00am-6:00pm London time&lt;/strong&gt;, providing full coverage of the European business day while maintaining regular collaboration with our San Francisco headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll typically spend:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mornings and early afternoons working directly with European customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Late afternoons collaborating with our US-based Sales, Product, and Engineering teams during our daily overlap window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 75% of your time traveling across Europe for customer meetings, executive workshops, pilots, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially this role will be remote from London. Once Pallet opens its London office, you’ll work from the office five days per week whenever you’re not traveling to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report directly to the &lt;strong&gt;General Manager, London&lt;/strong&gt; for territory strategy, customer relationships, and international expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also work closely with our &lt;strong&gt;Head of Sales&lt;/strong&gt;, participating in weekly pipeline reviews, forecasting, and sales process alignment with the US team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chat with Christy - Business Recruiter - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coffee Chat with Sales Team - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery Mock Interview - 45-60 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Interview - ~3 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief Background Check and Reference Check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, and we’ll keep you informed at every stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;£100,000-£240,000 OTE&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a standard 50/50 enterprise sales structure consisting of base salary and target commission. High performers are eligible for uncapped commission accelerators above quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, we offer competitive equity, benefits, and significant growth opportunities as one of our earliest international commercial hires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on experience, qualifications, and demonstrated enterprise sales performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people the same way we invest in our product: seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🩺 Health, Vision, and Dental benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏝️ Take-what-you-need Paid Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;➕ Life Insurance and Accidental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❤️‍🩹 Short-Term Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 Generous salary and equity for all staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🪜 401k option; helping you save for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒 Paid parental leave to support growing families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Yearly learning and development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚌 Commuter benefits for Bay Area employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚘 Uber ride stipend if you ever have to work late in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏡 Remote office home stipend to get you comfy in your space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍔 Daily catered lunches provided&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✈️ Onboarding trip to San Francisco HQ if you work remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥤 Monthly happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎉 Annual Company Offsites; our last one was in Palm Springs CA 🌴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an in-person company. Our offices in San Francisco, New York City and London are where ideas get built, decisions get made, and the team gets stronger. We have invested in making them genuinely great places to spend your day, with catered lunches, monthly happy hours, and people who care about the work and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of our team works in office five days a week. For select roles, we hire remotely across the U.S. Remote employees come to one of our offices for their first week to onboard and meet the team, and we cover the full trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every role is different. Travel expectations are always shared upfront in the job description and confirmed in your first call with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We make all employment decisions based solely on merit. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees without discrimination on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, disability status, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We prohibit any form of discrimination or harassment. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please review Pallet’s Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://pallet.com/privacy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet complies with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA), as amended by the ADA Amendments Act, and all applicable state or local laws. We will reasonably accommodate qualified individuals with a disability during the application process and throughout employment as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance or accommodations due to a disability, please contact us at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is an AI-native advertising platform built for the next era of performance marketing. We operate at the intersection of machine learning, programmatic media, and full-funnel mobile growth, powering campaigns for some of the world&#39;s most ambitious advertisers. Our platform is purpose-built to deliver outcomes at scale, not just impressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of builders, operators, and technologists who believe the advertising industry is overdue for a fundamental rethink. We move fast, operate with a high degree of ownership, and hold ourselves to an exceptionally high standard of craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is scaling aggressively with an active M&amp;amp;A pipeline and a platform vision that puts us on a path to becoming an industry leader. This is a rare opportunity to join a company at an inflection point and help shape what it becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager based in London, you will own a portfolio of strategically significant accounts across the UK and Western EMEA, driving revenue retention and growth for some of the most commercially important relationships in the region. This is a senior individual contributor role. You will operate with full autonomy from day one: leading your own growth plans, managing executive-level client relationships, and executing across the full account lifecycle without co-management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross-functional teams across Growth, Analytics, and Operations to launch and optimize campaigns, surface performance insights, and translate data into decisions that move the business. You will report to the EMEA Growth lead and collaborate with a lean, senior team that moves fast and holds itself to a high standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of RZR&#39;s EMEA strategy. The region manages a combined book of over $110K DRR across 30+ accounts, with a strong new business pipeline, and we need a senior operator who can own a meaningful portion of that portfolio independently and grow it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Revenue Retention &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive net growth to meet or exceed revenue targets across your assigned portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close upsell and cross-sell opportunities while actively managing churn risk and re-activation plays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product adoption and expansion to increase revenue quality and account depth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively surface client needs and gaps to inform both account strategy and commercial planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Client Ownership &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead account retention and growth plans with a multi-quarter forward view and clear, measurable milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships at all levels, from performance marketers to C-suite stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use QBRs and strategic sessions to drive progress, deepen engagement, and secure long-term commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product capabilities and market changes in ways that are clear, compelling, and directly relevant to each client&#39;s business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market insights and best practices that position RZR as a strategic partner, not just a vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Campaign Management &amp;amp; Performance Insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal teams to launch, execute, and optimize campaigns aligned to client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor account health and identify performance issues before they become client concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable insights tied to business impact, not just metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend creative and strategy adjustments to counter performance fatigue and sustain growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional coordination to meet client expectations and execute growth plans on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear escalation paths to resolve issues quickly and protect the client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct client training sessions, platform walkthroughs, and onboarding as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting, pipeline documentation, and reporting with full personal accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure financial alignment including timely invoicing and budget tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report accurately and consistently to regional EMEA and global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in mobile advertising, including at least 3 years in a client-facing growth or account management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of the programmatic advertising ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the UK market; established relationships with key advertisers and agencies across the UK and Western EMEA are a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build high-touch client relationships, manage in-person engagements, and calibrate the right frequency and depth of contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently managing and scaling commercial accounts, identifying and closing upsell and cross-sell opportunities without hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing the full account lifecycle in a commercially dense, competitive market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly and engage clients and team members in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly in a high-growth environment and lead growth initiatives with limited structural support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, able to engage confidently with clients from campaign managers to C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborator across diverse, globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analytics, machine learning, and advertising technology is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; an additional European language is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join RZR in London?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into direct ownership of a commercially significant EMEA portfolio from day one: full autonomy, full accountability, and no co-management required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a privacy-centric, AI-driven programmatic platform as the UK market deepens and the product portfolio (User Acquisition, Retargeting, CTV) actively expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn a competitive base salary plus a structured commission plan where your performance directly determines your earnings ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to global advertisers, senior cross-functional teams, and major industry events across EMEA and beyond, with regular in-person client engagement built into the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a small, senior team where your contributions are visible, your voice carries weight, and direct access to leadership accelerates your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Values&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR operates by eight core behaviours: Extreme Ownership · Move Fast · Drive for Excellence · Proactive Communication · Courage · Curiosity · Deliver Results · Manage Ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Endor Labs is building the Application Security platform for the software development revolution. Modern software is complex and dependency-rich, making it increasingly difficult to pinpoint the risks that truly matter. Endor Labs solves this challenge by building a call graph of your entire software estate—enabling teams to clearly identify, prioritize, and fix critical risks faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by companies that are one or one hundred years old, Endor Labs secures code whether it was written by humans or AI, and whether it&#39;s 40-year old C++ code or cutting edge Bazel Monorepos. Endor Labs was founded by serial entrepreneurs Varun Badhwar and Dimitri Stiliadis, and is backed by leading VC firms such as Dell Technology Capital, Lightspeed, and Sierra Ventures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound interesting? Let’s talk if you want to be part of the next big leap in security innovation!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring Enterprise Account Executives to own the full sales cycle—from discovery to close—driving new business with enterprise customers who care deeply about developer productivity and application security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technically complex, multi-threaded sale. Our buyers are CISOs, AppSec leaders, and engineering executives, and you&#39;ll translate Endor Labs&#39; capabilities into clear business value while partnering with Solution Architects, CS, SDRs, and Marketing. You won&#39;t inherit a full pipeline—you&#39;ll build it. The AEs who thrive here create demand and run a repeatable enterprise motion with intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Ownership &amp;amp; Pipeline Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals end to end, orchestrating SAs, CS, SDRs, and Marketing to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-source a meaningful share of your pipeline through strategic, trigger-based prospecting—you create demand, you don&#39;t wait for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling &amp;amp; MEDDPICC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run rigorous discovery and qualify with discipline using MEDDPICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a structured enterprise motion (e.g., Command of the Message) to move deals with purpose and predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Storytelling &amp;amp; Champion Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical depth into clear business outcomes and build a credible business case tied to measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the buying committee, build internal champions, and earn trusted-advisor status—you sell insight, not a feature checklist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast Discipline &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline rigorously, forecast with precision, and consistently exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment—taking ownership over titles to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a strategic, technical seller who loves simplifying complexity and guiding customers through transformation. You know how to navigate ambiguity, collaborate deeply, and earn trust through insight and credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle enterprise sales experience in cybersecurity, DevOps, or developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of closing multi-threaded, six-figure deals with enterprise accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a structured, playbook-driven motion—Command of the Message, Force Management, MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC), or a comparable value-selling methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated over-attainment: President&#39;s Club, top-decile ranking, or a consistent record of beating quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve done your best work at high-growth companies where you had to &lt;em&gt;create&lt;/em&gt; demand, not fulfill inbound—and you know the difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling to technical buyers—CISOs, Heads of Security, Engineering and Developer Productivity leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High curiosity and initiative—you don&#39;t follow scripts, you lead the conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;The Bar We Hire To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hold a bar above the market, and we&#39;re transparent about what it is. The best reps at Endor aren&#39;t defined by pedigree—they&#39;re defined by how they operate. We hire people who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with character.&lt;/strong&gt; Commitment, humility, and grit. You&#39;ve overcome something hard, you want to be the best, and you carry a strong moral compass into every room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are coachable by default.&lt;/strong&gt; You seek feedback, act on it fast, and treat every deal as a chance to get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think sharply and translate complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You build a credible business case and make hard concepts simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have proven it where it&#39;s hard.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve carried a number at a high-growth, not-yet-household-name company and consistently beaten it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Endor Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building at the intersection of developer productivity and security — one of the fastest-growing spaces in software. Our dev-loved platform has real ROI, strong momentum, and customers who care about doing things right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Endor Labs, we think big, start small, and learn fast. We take ownership, move with purpose, and always start with the customer’s success. We debate with data, make the complex simple, and challenge each other with kindness and candor. We celebrate wins, learn from misses, and have fun along the way — because when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Today’s most tomorrow company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We run the most powerful battery on the grid, the 850MW Waratah Super Battery, and getting the next ones connected is your job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are leading the energy transition towards a better, brighter tomorrow. The work you will do makes a real and very tangible impact on the future of the planet and its people. We’re 200 people around the world with 40 GWh of projects moving through development across Australia, Japan, the US and Germany.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We build, own, and operate our assets, we don’t hand a project to someone else once it’s approved. The people who design a battery site are the same people who build it and run it for the next twenty years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ou’ll lead our connection applications end to end, from first enquiry through to registration, working closely with Commercial and Engineering to get the settings right from day one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the Connection Application process end to end, including Connection Enquiries, Generator Performance Standards, design and modelling packages, validation, Hold Point testing and registration submissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Business Developers and Engineering to optimise project designs, equipment selection and grid connection planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Liaise directly with OEMs, external consultants and AEMO/NSPs, troubleshooting power system models and control system performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Negotiate technical performance standards with AEMO and NSPs, balancing our long-term operation of the asset against regulatory requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Keep across new rules and regulations, and help shape our responses to proposed changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How you’ll make a positive&amp;nbsp;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A degree in Electrical, Control or Power Systems Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in renewables or electrical engineering, ideally on utility-scale or power transmission projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of NEM grid connection processes and Australian engineering standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Comfort with power system modelling tools like PSSE, PSCAD or PowerFactory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why you’ll love working here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexibility first: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we&#39;re hybrid by design, averaging 60/40 office and home split, and real trust to flex that mix when life calls for it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Room to look after yourself: $1,500 a year for your wellbeing, plus $2,000 and two extra days off for your own development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Genuinely generous parental leave: because family isn’t something you fit around a job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A stake in what we build: on top of your salary and twice-yearly bonus, permanent team members also share in the value we create through our Long Term Incentive Plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the energy transition with us. Apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe diverse teams build better solutions for the planet and its people. We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels respected, supported, and able to do their best work, no matter their background, identity, or lived experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Speechmatics, we’re expanding our user platform offering. We&#39;re looking for a Senior Front-End Software Engineer with a strong product mindset to help drive that growth. This is an opportunity to own end-to-end feature development at a leading-edge AI company, from shaping the user experience through to shipping and iterating based on real user feedback and analytics data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product features from ideation through to delivery, contributing to UX thinking, frontend execution, and post-launch iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build polished, accessible user interfaces using React, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make UX and UI decisions independently, collaborating closely with designers and PMs rather than waiting on detailed handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run A/B tests to validate product decisions and surface insights that improve the user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use analytics tooling such as Mixpanel to understand how people interact with the product and feed that learning back into what gets built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend engineers, product managers, and designers to ship features that genuinely move the needle for users and the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain robust UI tests, taking ownership of quality in production and at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run user interviews and meet customers to understand how people use the product and what drives adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in React, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS with a track record of shipping production-quality frontend code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-minded engineering approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort owning UX and UI decisions independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with iterative development practices, including A/B testing and feature experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with user analytics tools such as Mixpanel or a comparable platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UI testing frameworks and a solid grounding in frontend engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence collaborating cross-functionally with designers, PMs, and backend engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of using user feedback and data to improve features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice to have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using coding agents (eg Claude, Codex, OpenCode) to improve productivity and code quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to backend development, including RESTful APIs and cloud deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting or participating in user interviews as part of a product discovery process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not feel you match all of the requirements exactly. The list of requirements is intended to show the kinds of experience and qualities we’re looking for, but it is not exhaustive. If you are interested in the role, the team, and our mission, we would love to consider your application. We are always open to conversations and look forward to hearing from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Speechmatics is the leading expert in Speech Intelligence, and uses AI and Machine Learning to unlock business value in human speech worldwide. We work with an amazing mix of global companies, and our technology can integrate into our customers stack irrespective of their industry or use case – making it the go-to solution to harness useful information from speech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Joining us means working with some of the smartest minds around the world, focused on cutting-edge projects and deploying the latest techniques to disrupt the market. We believe in putting people first; we’ll do all we can to help you develop your skills and give you the tools you need to thrive. Our Focus Fridays give you an undisturbed day of focus, offset with Together Tuesdays when we have our team meetings, so you&#39;ve always got the right balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We have structured a hybrid approach that includes 2-3 designated office days each week. This arrangement ensures that while we embrace the advantages of remote work, we also maintain the vital connection and synergy that only in-person interactions can foster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This is only the beginning; we’re looking for amazing people like you to continue our journey…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;No matter what stage of your career you’re at - from paid internships and first-job opportunities through to management and senior positions - we’ll support you with the training and development needed to reach your career aspirations with us. There really is no shortage of opportunities here for you to get involved and collaborate with those around you to deliver your best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We offer incredibly flexible working, regular company lunches, and birthday celebrations. But that’s not all. We’ve spoken to our teams to find out what they want. From Private Medical, and Dental for you and your family, through to global working opportunities, a generous holiday allowance and pension/401K matching, we want to make sure our employees and their families are looked after. Every employee will receive a working from home allowance for tech or home office equipment (on top of your choice of laptop and accessories of course). Our approach to parental leave is designed to support employees globally. While this varies by geo, we have support in place for parents (including adoption assistance and reproductive health services) to ensure they have the time and financial resources needed to care for their growing families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Speechmatics, our mission is simple: Understand Every Voice out there.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s not just about our tech – it&#39;s the heart and soul of who we are.&amp;nbsp;We welcome different experiences, viewpoints, and identities. For us, it’s not just the right thing to do; it’s our catalyst for sparking innovation and creativity. Our teams thrive in an environment that celebrates and supports everyone – no matter their gender, identity or expression, race, disability, age, sexual orientation, religion, belief, marital status, national origin, veteran status, pregnancy, or maternity status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But we don’t just open the door to diversity – we actively welcome it. Why? Because we believe every unique voice adds something special to our team, leading us to smarter solutions and a better workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, come as you are and join our Speechling community.&lt;/strong&gt; We’re building a place where every voice not only gets heard but is also respected and valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on us&lt;sub&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub&gt;please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.speechmatics.com/&quot;&gt;our website&lt;/a&gt; and follow Speechmatics on our social channels via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Speechmatics/&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/speechmatics/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/speechmatics/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaZUN77-Wq0XQg5ICHLxKVw/&quot;&gt;YouTube.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
